<title>NETHERLANDS: ING starts rating of Vedior with a Sell.</title>
<headline>ING starts rating of Vedior with a Sell.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Research note summary (10/07)</p>
<p>Company---------Sector--------Price---Broker----------------</p>
<p>Vedior	    temp agencies 52.00   ING Barings</p>
<p>COMMENT: Sell</p>
<p>We initiate our coverage of Vedior with a Sell recommendation since we believe the company is overvalued compared to its peer group, consisting of Adecco, Manpower and Randstad.</p>
<p>    Estimates (NLG):  EPS    P/E</p>
<p>    1996/97	     1.71   30.3</p>
<p>    1997/98	     2.11   24.6</p>
<p>    1998/99	     2.56   20.3</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom, +31 20 504 5000 (Fax +31 20 504 5040)</p>
